    "https://atomicdata.dev/properties/datatype": "https://atomicdata.dev/datatypes/string",
    "https://atomicdata.dev/properties/description": "On the Inbox: where to mail Notifications, for servers that do not know the owner's address from an account. Only read from an Inbox in a drive that nobody but its owner reads or writes."
  },
  {
